        {
          "id": "55c37ed3-1e1e-4def-9732-2983dc1d312f",
          "title": "Identification of DG",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "97d99c57-27d7-44b0-ab2c-fb433044b69d",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3>Identification of Dangerous Goods</h3><p>All ground staff must be trained to spot dangerous goods (DGs) belonging to passengers. If a passenger or crew member is suspected of carrying DGs that are not allowed or approved, staff should check and gather more details about the item(s).</p><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "f7667970-f30a-4d3b-a286-4a0bed999113",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>How to identify DG?</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "5b8da738-720b-4a9a-bbb1-d5c33864ed9c",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/screenshot-2026-06-05-111706-3f25f59f-5046-4b5a-b5-11.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/screenshot-2026-06-05-111706-3f25f59f-5046-4b5a-b5-11.png"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "f75d83a1-468d-4b89-a673-37023984e982",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3>Hidden DG</h3><p>Some dangerous goods (DGs) may be hidden inside normal-looking cargo. They might be part of a product that seems harmless. Common examples include items that contain chemicals, batteries, or pressurised materials.</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "75b292e3-b584-4bcd-9bb5-f092a9c33e3a",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/screenshot-2026-06-05-112333-4eab7e09-9164-45b3-af-12.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/screenshot-2026-06-05-112333-4eab7e09-9164-45b3-af-12.png"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "e9b41247-3d5c-4454-99b9-34c7fac53952",
              "type": "tabs",
              "content": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "fbea6425-db69-4e83-86d3-14bd510837b4",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "7753e880-3db5-44fb-8264-8e29bfc55122",
                        "type": "image",
                        "content": "media/gettyimages-808894866-5a0fdc63ec2f640036506a24-f29-13.jpeg",
                        "originalContent": "media/gettyimages-808894866-5a0fdc63ec2f640036506a24-f29-13.jpeg"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "f77c49a0-2ab0-435f-b0ec-cb6cfa0d576f",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Examples:</strong> Scuba tanks, vest bottles, or other cylinders containing compressed gases (air, oxygen, etc.); high intensity diving lamps that can get extremely hot.</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "6a51c310-6835-4fb3-b237-645e9d428f41",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Dangers:</strong> Risk of explosion or fire if gas leaks or lamps overheat</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "aecd12c9-8c6f-4c31-a2af-03283bec3a8d",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Things to note:</strong> Bulbs or batteries must be disconnected before transport.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "label": "Diving Equipment"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "b58c83c9-2c23-4b25-b1ba-a79033d008c9",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "93836898-338f-49cf-bf11-002907e9b166",
                        "type": "image",
                        "content": "media/61dfmxmxgnl-ac-uf1000-1000-ql80-4cbc50e7-d0d2-4d6d-14.jpeg",
                        "originalContent": "media/61dfmxmxgnl-ac-uf1000-1000-ql80-4cbc50e7-d0d2-4d6d-14.jpeg"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "2f36ca94-ba47-434c-8e7a-7d6e21881878",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Examples:</strong> Camping gear like gas stoves, lanterns, and fuel bottles may contain flammable gases (butane, propane), liquids (kerosene, gasoline), or solids (hexamine tablets, matches).</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "995beef4-1a1a-4812-985e-339d4f12f921",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Dangers:</strong> Fire and explosion risk if not handled or packed properly</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "ac3aa2c4-9705-4623-9293-ee3ed62de828",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Things to note:</strong> Always check for leaks and keep fuel sources separated and secured.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "label": "Camping Equipment"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "36f77733-0000-4b44-83b1-87b65c1de6f3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "e82275d1-c6b3-4f6e-af4f-6e2f3c581ede",
                        "type": "image",
                        "content": "media/flammable-materials-4-434b43fc-6db1-4d88-ad31-7df2-15.jpeg",
                        "originalContent": "media/flammable-materials-4-434b43fc-6db1-4d88-ad31-7df2-15.jpeg"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "1ac6feee-c655-4095-94dc-2d8ef1076644",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><span><strong>Examples:</strong> Everyday items like paints, adhesives, polishes, aerosols, bleach, oven or drain cleaners, and matches may contain flammable or corrosive substances.</span></p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "fc784636-5791-4dd1-936d-05421aadefcb",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><span><strong>Dangers:</strong> Fire, explosion, or chemical burns if spilled or mishandled.</span></p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "2cc3e1ab-63e8-4cad-a084-49229dd14b38",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p><strong>Things to note: </strong>Always check labels and pack securely before transport.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "label": "Household Goods"
                  }
                ],
                "orientation": "vertical"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ab1e2f84-48a7-4264-9b89-00652f4369a1",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3>Handling/Reporting DG</h3><p>If encountering DG how do we proceed from there?</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "77c8a9d5-42dd-4258-bc7e-cb31bb0dfc5f",
              "type": "accordion",
              "content": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "5925e321-3a65-4c08-a7ee-7a4c5273e135",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "8f0d259b-e547-4c48-a10f-d3d04f254e55",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>When the person offering the item cannot prove it’s not dangerous goods (DG), refuse to accept the container for transport.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "If unsure"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "d23f7af4-46e0-4476-9255-fc3f3c5809d4",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "74eb476d-b627-4554-840d-db8d199c199e",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>The person must remove and dispose of the item safely outside airport property.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "If not immediately dangerous"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "07507aba-04fd-4424-9ef8-ab4abcde8a34",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "6052b077-7831-4ccb-b1ca-8e03a065058d",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Report immediately to your Supervisor/Manager, Airport Emergency Services (AES), Airport Police, or Seletar Airport Operations (SAO).</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "If disposal cannot be done safely"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "fc03aaf2-bc23-4a55-bd94-d41c2699f189",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "89953418-31e9-4492-a4d5-15aaab03ebf3",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Any staff who discovers a dangerous goods (DG) accident or incident must inform their Supervisor/Manager, Airport Police, Airport Emergency Services (AES), Seletar Airport Operations (SAO), CAAS, and CAG.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Immediate Reporting"
                  }
                ],
                "allowMultiple": false
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "59c8c8f0-ac39-4abc-b11f-f81cd014e013",
          "title": "Emergency Ground Procedure",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "7f97aaaf-f8cc-421f-baf7-404636542ee5",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3>What to do during an emergency?</h3><p>How should it be handled</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d7bb130d-81a4-4b11-a740-144136cb5aa8",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/screenshot-2026-06-05-114246-33446a5c-26b6-4acb-82-16.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/screenshot-2026-06-05-114246-33446a5c-26b6-4acb-82-16.png"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c4dee52f-60f2-4e81-ba71-e942f88a64d2",
      "title": "Human Factors",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "c03430ee-a4a1-4f74-bafc-e5b2929ce7bd",
          "title": "Introduction to Human Factors",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "8b855a93-501d-428b-a54b-e13e705303b1",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"> Understanding Human Factors</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2c69b3ef-81fa-4a66-a342-95b094e82da4",
              "type": "accordion",
              "content": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "88f961ef-c73f-4949-94bb-43d7585d1d39",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "6fa19a9a-e609-449b-879d-af55b5a9ee5d",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Human factors refer to the complex interactions between humans, technology, and the environment in which aviation activities take place. They encompass cognitive, physical, and organizational factors that influence human performance.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Definition of Human Factors"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "68c0dcb1-7351-4ecd-a6fa-ffdd07626daa",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "af8fe04e-75bc-480e-b5b5-699ad2bb9914",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Human factors significantly impact aviation safety, operational efficiency, and the overall quality of air transportation services.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Significance of Human Factors"
                  }
                ],
                "allowMultiple": false
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "3d8ec326-e956-417e-864c-20bbf89dde8c",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Categories of Human Factors</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "59489d09-933b-4c65-882b-c8d44f95bc65",
              "type": "accordion",
              "content": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "4e05ab09-880f-423e-b811-1cb7a82d5626",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "b6120118-5e4a-42a3-9b2c-b415b78c2e42",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Discuss the psychological aspects affecting decision-making, perception, memory, and attention. Explore how cognitive factors contribute to errors.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Cognitive Factors"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "9117e889-7539-49e7-9303-988358c94195",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "72ca412b-4a1e-4e86-be09-253a8d8b4f42",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Address the impact of physical capabilities and limitations on aviation tasks, such as ergonomics and physical stress.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Physical Factors"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "d2044a9f-820e-490d-8fbd-e2a1be73a4ce",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "224a83c4-805b-41fb-9d10-b880dac15d7a",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Explore the influence of organizational culture, communication, and leadership on aviation safety and performance.</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Organizational Factors"
                  }
                ],
                "allowMultiple": false
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1dc0f00d-8d74-402f-9c20-925e21fb40bb",
          "title": "The \"Dirty Dozen\"",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "0f392d06-f6e0-437b-b843-e374eaf8c963",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Introduction to the \"Dirty Dozen\"</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "385e3b26-3fdb-43bf-a61e-f2e9d656fb30",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/image-2026-06-23-232208664-1c44aff0-a0b6-40eb-829e-17.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/image-2026-06-23-232208664-1c44aff0-a0b6-40eb-829e-17.png"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "99e76184-12f6-4bb8-8081-17604b431f78",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>Together they are a collection of twelve human factors often associated with aviation accidents. These factors highlight the importance of understanding the human aspects of aviation operations and the critical role they play in ensuring safety and preventing errors.</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "0f9c4a4c-2ccf-44b8-bbac-3fea36842c4d",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">The \"Dirty Dozen\"</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b0891e1f-ac4b-423e-9945-16b7c59180b3",
              "type": "table",
              "content": {
                "rows": [
                  {
                    "id": "4d10f1a1-6be4-4fd2-bcf1-e1f3c45780c7",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "87930bcb-9bf1-4900-8966-1a09367b9600",
                        "html": "<p>Lack of Communication</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "d6b25723-ae53-4251-9c01-69508d3eb37b",
                        "html": "<p>Inadequate information sharing among personnel</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "372daf10-6c2d-485d-bb73-18918f65c9e9",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "6a2eacd4-cdfe-4677-a09d-19e426dfa538",
                        "html": "<p>Lack of Knowledge</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "796bf64e-7aea-4b98-9184-a2a27c5a584a",
                        "html": "<p>Insufficient understanding of procedures, equipment, or tasks</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "c6dd5386-97c4-459a-a759-2f5ff2a1e5cc",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "cbc24bf5-241e-469c-85b3-ca4d939f22c6",
                        "html": "<p>Lack of Teamwork </p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "4e999d3d-c6ab-4da1-afa4-b9b46964159b",
                        "html": "<p>Poor collaboration and coordination among crew members</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "79765147-3d4e-4d92-9fb4-8c176ab65d81",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "1126df89-3357-4ced-b97c-258b71ab02d3",
                        "html": "<p>Lack of Resources</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "2c28e6ee-65a3-414a-9bd1-4bf0051b168e",
                        "html": "<p>Insufficient tools, information, or support for tasks</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "d32e47cb-1dab-4614-be27-f773905e367c",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "959962a7-1f34-4617-832d-1b719c34130a",
                        "html": "<p>Lack of Assertiveness</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "12c2f41a-a057-4cc7-8e57-225eb2175c59",
                        "html": "<p>Hesitation to speak up about concerns or errors</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "988b7b49-c217-4844-b4a9-af3f5d055e48",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "bd111b1f-6090-4036-aaae-deeee3ce546f",
                        "html": "<p>Lack of Awareness</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "94259a72-828a-48b6-a6d8-0b9993588f63",
                        "html": "<p>Incomplete situational awareness or failure to recognise risks</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "231bf650-6b4c-43f2-b771-874b5207e3a8",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "6d4f8f9e-dfda-45e1-8ae8-9ff6aba8fbbb",
                        "html": "<p>Complacency</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "fd9f1c82-cabc-4576-912c-3d2123e4b561",
                        "html": "<p>Overconfidence leading to a lack of vigilance and attention</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "05a35ef7-aa81-4227-a254-17915657d157",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "c5938dcd-8914-46b5-8849-124a0a3f92fa",
                        "html": "<p>Distraction</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "f7763325-f0fd-4e24-95c5-84d55ad14943",
                        "html": "<p>Diverted attention from critical tasks due to various reasons</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "e80ebdb4-0bf6-4285-815a-8bf54506c958",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "9d68f88c-e525-438f-865a-280661b0bc95",
                        "html": "<p>Fatigue</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "5eb9b11f-2bed-48aa-bb81-41d6d06c50e3",
                        "html": "<p>Impaired performance due to physical and mental exhaustion</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "8730fd40-aafc-432a-b2f1-11a47f7a6ffc",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "66fe2b55-9817-4100-814e-51269e8d9c20",
                        "html": "<p>Pressure</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "e1a6c1c4-3c68-4110-bde6-bff1f57b5ddd",
                        "html": "<p>Stressful situations influencing decision-making negatively</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "1a768700-690b-4bb9-9683-dfebcd798085",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "d382a990-b975-4c7e-8b67-c863dce0d987",
                        "html": "<p><strong>Stress</strong></p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "73f50d09-db02-4a1c-aa3b-ca7202aabf7a",
                        "html": "<p>Emotional or psychological strain impacting performance</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "452a0292-2968-44b1-8d8a-e42154612fc2",
                    "cells": [
                      {
                        "id": "dfcdbebf-c677-4e04-95fa-bdaceb49a276",
                        "html": "<p>Norms</p>"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "8f5bba1b-5a31-44cc-8961-14db211a6429",
                        "html": "<p>Adherence to established practices, even when they are unsafe</p>"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "striping": "none",
                "headerRow": false,
                "borderStyle": "all",
                "columnCount": 2,
                "headerColumn": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cdf306c3-b71b-46c1-9110-b3736fc4f373",
          "title": "Mitigating Human Factors",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "ed131594-46a4-462c-8c95-d20c255c6e6e",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Identifying and Addressing Human Factors</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "a26d0911-fbc0-452b-a037-9fccdd793e18",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>To mitigate human factors, regular risk assessments are vital to recognize potential risks. Implementing open reporting channels fosters a culture of reporting concerns without fear of reprisal. </p><p>Thorough analyses of incidents and accidents enable the identification of underlying human factor contributions. </p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "1340323f-2b1f-4255-beb8-d0008bf4bb28",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/image-2026-06-23-233333915-d174c12e-5991-4168-b19f-18.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/image-2026-06-23-233333915-d174c12e-5991-4168-b19f-18.png"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fc49e6c3-2c7c-4649-991b-11f324723979",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Training and Education</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "0ffec8bd-e786-4b55-b698-593a9075bd71",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>Raising awareness about human factors, their consequences, and mitigation strategies is crucial. </p><p>Crew Resource Management (CRM) training enhances communication, teamwork, and decision-making skills among aviation professionals. </p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "01ce3a86-efc4-4f3e-a766-386d57d2604b",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/image-2026-06-23-233501815-3886c863-4265-4ec6-b197-19.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/image-2026-06-23-233501815-3886c863-4265-4ec6-b197-19.png"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "40c1d37b-1436-4263-8616-a910c696b467",
          "title": "Promoting Aviation Safety",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d1673bad-d5b7-40e5-984f-dbc6407a507e",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Implementing Safety Culture</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fdfc14d2-af8f-4886-a15d-07cbe4d75841",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>Safety culture prioritizes shared values, attitudes, and practices that place safety at the forefront. </p><p>A robust safety culture proactively manages human factors and encourages reporting and learning from errors. </p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "e0f996e1-b5f2-4a1d-934b-a9c7c08baacd",
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "alt": "",
                "src": "media/image-2026-06-23-233909707-a02d779b-6083-45fb-a65d-20.png",
                "align": "center",
                "width": "large",
                "originalSrc": "media/image-2026-06-23-233909707-a02d779b-6083-45fb-a65d-20.png"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "dc0af0fc-c169-4488-9db1-67df23664021",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Reporting and Feedback</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d4172016-fab3-40be-aa57-faac4ecab94a",
              "type": "accordion",
              "content": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "5d21025f-2f30-4d29-85df-7a60d65f4f12",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "93dc27b8-ef30-4b14-8a06-66a6f32cb143",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Encourage personnel to report incidents and near-misses to identify trends and potential hazards</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Open Reporting"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "83016621-1b2d-40ef-8776-a472aa03f660",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "id": "cff939af-f481-4149-8508-119aef4b2f9d",
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "<p>Use reported data to enhance training programs and operational procedures continually</p>"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": "Learning Culture"
                  }
                ],
                "allowMultiple": false
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "bf89aeb5-bd2a-4b3c-bf3e-11095c4bb15d",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Embracing Human Factors in Aviation</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "e3a83f5c-73d3-4521-8505-d3c8f88b8849",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>Recognizing and addressing human factors is pivotal for aviation safety. By embracing best practices, raising awareness, and fostering a safety culture, aviation professionals contribute to enhanced safety and performance.</p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "9311a816-6989-4eef-994a-d8b311741f9e",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Continuous Learning</h3><p></p>"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "860b2fbe-3f62-42f1-9385-91a67f4bca52",
              "type": "text",
              "content": {
                "html": "<p>As aviation evolves, staying updated with dynamic human factors is essential. Technology advancements, regulatory changes, and operational shifts necessitate continuous learning for sustained safety and operational efficiency. </p>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
